	(text "Serial port 1 is set for COM1 JP6/jumper1 pins 1 & 2 closed (0x3F8-0x3FF)\nSerial port 1 is set for COM3 JP6/jumper1 pins 2 & 3 closed (0x3E8-0x3EF)\n\nSerial port 1 enabled JP6/jumper 2 pins 1 & 2 closed\nSerial port 1 disabled JP6/jumper 2 pins 2 & 3 closed\n\nSerial port 2 is set for COM2 JP6/jumper 3 pins 1 & 2 closed (0x2F8-0x2FF)\nSerial port 2 is set for COM4 JP6/jumper 3 pins 2 & 3 closed (0x2E8-0x2EF)\n\nSerial port 2 enabled JP6/jumper 4 pins 1 & 2 closed\nSerial port 2 disabled JP6/jumper 4 pins 2 & 3 closed\n\nParallel port is set for LPT1 (0x378) JP6/jumper 5 pins 1 & 2 closed\nParallel port is set for LPT2 (0x278) JP6/jumper 5 pins 2 & 3 closed\n\nParallel port enabled JP6/jumper 6 pins 1 & 2 closed\nParallel port disabled JP6/jumper 6 pins 2 & 3 closed\n\nGame port enabled JP6/jumper 7 pins 1 & 2 closed\nGame port disabled JP6/jumper 7 pins 2 & 3 closed\n\nFloppy drive enabled JP6/jumper 8 pins 1 & 2 closed\nFloppy drive disabled JP6/jumper 8 pins 2 & 3 closed"
